<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>FleetHound | Fleet Operations</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#080b0e;--panel:#12191f;--line:#2a353d;--orange:#f47b0b;--text:#f3f6f8;--muted:#a6b1ba}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Arial}button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px}.app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:255px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:100vh}.side{background:#0c1217;border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}.brand{text-align:center;padding:10px 0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hound{font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#d73b29}.brand strong{font-size:25px;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-1px}.brand strong span{color:var(--orange)}.brand small{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:3px}.nav{display:grid;gap:5px}.nav button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 13px;color:#d5dce1;background:transparent;text-align:left}.nav button.active,.nav button:hover{background:#d96905;color:white}.nav .symbol{width:22px;text-align:center;font-size:19px}.bottom{margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:15px}.main{min-width:0}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 24px;background:#11171d;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.company,.user{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;background:#0c1115;color:#fff}.user{border:0;background:transparent}.hero{min-height:175px;padding:30px 25px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#101519 0%,rgba(13,17,20,.9) 48%,rgba(14,16,18,.25) 100%),linear-gradient(165deg,#3c1d10 25%,#e15b0b 72%,#19110d 73%);display:flex;align-items:center}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,38px);margin:0 0 5px}.hero p{margin:0;color:#d7d7d7;font-size:17px}.content{padding:20px 24px 40px;max-width:1500px;margin:auto}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--orange);font-weight:700;margin:0 0 10px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#161f26,#0e1419);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:19px}.stat{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center}.stat .ico{font-size:29px}.stat label{display:block;color:#c6d0d6;font-size:13px}.stat strong{font-size:32px}.orange{color:var(--orange)}.green{color:#35c85a}.red{color:#f14c42}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.45fr;gap:15px;margin-top:16px}h2{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:21px}.compliance{display:flex;gap:23px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.donut{width:165px;height:165px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#2bc650 0 92%,#e23a31 92% 96%,#707d86 96%);display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0}.donut>div{width:116px;height:116px;border-radius:50%;background:#12191f;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.donut strong{font-size:35px}.donut small{color:var(--muted)}.legend{flex:1;min-width:110px}.legend p{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:8px;color:#c7d0d7}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:470px;text-align:left}th,td{padding:11px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}.pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px;font-weight:700}.pass{background:#125e2a}.fail{background:#9a251f}.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:16px}.action{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#172027,#0d1216);color:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px 10px;min-height:145px}.action:hover{border-color:var(--orange)}.action:first-child{border-color:var(--orange);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#5b2c0a,#211810)}.action .icon{display:block;font-size:32px;margin-bottom:10px}.action strong{display:block;font-size:16px}.action small{display:block;color:#b8c1c8;margin-top:7px}.notice{margin:15px 0 0;padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #6d4c24;background:#2c2116;border-radius:9px;color:#ffd2a1;font-size:13px}.page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}.page h1{margin:0 0 8px}.page p{color:var(--muted)}.list{display:grid;gap:10px}.list-item{padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:center}.btn{background:var(--orange);border:0;color:#16110b;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:750}.muted{color:var(--muted)}#menuBtn{display:none}@media(max-width:1050px){.stats,.actions{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:700px){.app{display:block}.side{display:none;position:fixed;z-index:10;top:0;bottom:0;width:265px;overflow:auto;box-shadow:20px 0 50px #000a}.side.open{display:flex}#menuBtn{display:inline-block;background:#252f37;color:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:8px 11px}.top{padding:12px}.hero{min-height:140px;padding:24px 15px}.hero p{font-size:14px}.content{padding:15px 12px 35px}.stats,.actions{gap:9px}.card{padding:14px}.stat{gap:7px}.stat .ico{font-size:22px}.stat label{font-size:11px}.stat strong{font-size:25px}.action{padding:14px 7px;min-height:126px}.action strong{font-size:13px}.action small{font-size:11px}.user{font-size:12px}.company{font-size:12px}}
.brand-logo{display:block;width:100%;max-width:225px;height:auto;margin:0 auto 8px;object-fit:contain}.brand{padding-top:0}
</style></head><body><div class="app"><aside class="side" id="sidebar"><div class="brand"><img class="brand-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="FleetHound redbone hound logo"><small>TRACK IT. CHECK IT. PROTECT IT.</small></div><nav class="nav" id="nav"><button class="active" data-page="dashboard"><span class="symbol">⌂</span>Dashboard</button><button data-page="equipment"><span class="symbol">🚜</span>Equipment</button><button data-page="inspections"><span class="symbol">☑</span>Inspections</button><button data-page="qr"><span class="symbol">▦</span>QR Codes</button><button data-page="maintenance"><span class="symbol">🔧</span>Maintenance</button><button data-page="reports"><span class="symbol">▥</span>Reports</button><button data-page="users"><span class="symbol">♟</span>Users & Crews</button><button data-page="settings"><span class="symbol">⚙</span>Company Settings</button></nav><div class="bottom muted">FleetHound • Demo Preview</div></aside><div class="main"><header class="top"><button id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open navigation">☰</button><div class="company">▦ &nbsp; Demo Company ▾</div><div class="user">● &nbsp; Demo Admin ▾</div></header><section id="dashboard" class="page active"><div class="hero"><div><h1>Welcome to FleetHound</h1><p>Here's what's happening with your fleet today.</p></div></div><div class="content"><p class="eyebrow">Operations overview • Sample data</p><div class="stats"><div class="card stat"><span class="ico orange">⛑</span><div><label>Total Equipment</label><strong>46</strong></div></div><div class="card stat"><span class="ico green">✔</span><div><label>Inspections Today</label><strong>38</strong></div></div><div class="card stat"><span class="ico red">⚠</span><div><label>Failed Inspections</label><strong>2</strong></div></div><div class="card stat"><span class="ico orange">🔧</span><div><label>Maintenance Due</label><strong>5</strong></div></div></div><div class="two"><div class="card"><h2>Inspection Compliance</h2><p class="muted">Last 30 days • Example</p><div class="compliance"><div class="donut"><div><strong>92%</strong><small>Compliant</small></div></div><div class="legend"><p><span>🟢 Completed</span><b>421</b></p><p><span>🔴 Failed</span><b>18</b></p><p><span>⚪ Missed</span><b>23</b></p></div></div></div><div class="card"><h2>Recent Inspections</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Equipment</th><th>Operator</th><th>Result</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SL-014 · Scissor Lift</td><td>J. Miller</td><td><span class="pill pass">Pass</span></td><td>8:32 AM</td></tr><tr><td>EX-003 · Excavator</td><td>T. Redd</td><td><span class="pill pass">Pass</span></td><td>8:17 AM</td></tr><tr><td>TL-007 · Telehandler</td><td>C. Hayes</td><td><span class="pill fail">Fail</span></td><td>7:59 AM</td></tr><tr><td>TR-011 · Service Truck</td><td>D. Carter</td><td><span class="pill pass">Pass</span></td><td>7:41 AM</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="action" data-go="inspections"><span class="icon orange">☑</span><strong>Start Inspection</strong><small>Perform a daily equipment check</small></button><button class="action" data-go="qr"><span class="icon">▦</span><strong>Scan QR Code</strong><small>Quickly pull up equipment</small></button><button class="action" data-go="maintenance"><span class="icon">🔧</span><strong>Request Maintenance</strong><small>Create a service request</small></button><button class="action" data-go="reports"><span class="icon">▥</span><strong>View Reports</strong><small>Inspections, failures, and trends</small></button></div><div class="notice">DEMO MODE — All equipment, names, dates, and numbers shown are fictional. No real logins, QR scanning, or inspection submissions are connected yet.</div></div></section><section id="equipment" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>Equipment Inventory</h1><p>Example equipment records. Real inventory will load from Supabase later.</p><div class="list"><div class="list-item"><span>🚜 SL-014 — Scissor Lift</span><span class="pill pass">Active</span></div><div class="list-item"><span>🚜 EX-003 — Excavator</span><span class="pill pass">Active</span></div><div class="list-item"><span>🚜 TL-007 — Telehandler</span><span class="pill fail">Out of Service</span></div><div class="list-item"><span>🚚 TR-011 — Service Truck</span><span class="pill pass">Active</span></div></div></div></section><section id="inspections" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>Inspections</h1><p>Daily inspection forms and completed records will appear here.</p><div class="card"><h2>Inspection workflow</h2><p>Scan equipment → complete checklist → record failures → submit. Submissions are disabled until secure database rules are complete.</p></div></div></section><section id="qr" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>QR Codes</h1><p>Each piece of equipment will receive a unique QR code linked to its inspection page.</p><div class="card">QR generation and camera scanning are not active in this demo.</div></div></section><section id="maintenance" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>Maintenance</h1><p>Failed inspections, repair assignments, and return-to-service approvals will appear here.</p><div class="card">⚠ Demo: TL-007 — Telehandler — requires inspection review.</div></div></section><section id="reports" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>Reports</h1><p>Company inspection trends, equipment history, and downloadable reports will appear here.</p></div></section><section id="users" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>Users & Crews</h1><p>Employee invitations, company roles, and crew assignments will appear here.</p></div></section><section id="settings" class="page"><div class="content"><h1>Company Settings</h1><p>Manage equipment types, checklist templates, and company preferences.</p></div></section></div></div><script>
const sidebar=document.getElementById('sidebar');function showPage(id){document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.id===id));document.querySelectorAll('#nav button').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.page===id));sidebar.classList.remove('open');window.scrollTo(0,0)}document.querySelectorAll('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showPage(b.dataset.page)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-go]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showPage(b.dataset.go)));document.getElementById('menuBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>sidebar.classList.toggle('open'));
</script></body></html>
